      "key": "weapons",
      "label": "Weapons",
      "type": "repeating-group",
      "helpText": "2024-only concept: every weapon now carries a Mastery Property (Cleave, Graze, Nick, Push, Sap, Slow, Topple, or Vex), but a character can only use the mastery property of a weapon type their class currently grants access to. The 2014 rules have no weapon mastery system at all.",
